  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "What moved and what stayed",
      "items": [
        "Five regions of markup became components; every piece of state another part of Shell reads stayed in Shell, so no effect runs in a different order",
        "The exception is the header, whose share and update hooks had no other reader and went with it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Checked",
      "items": [
        "A throwaway harness ran the old Shell from git and the new one side by side through 40 interactions in 5 scenarios and compared the markup after every step",
        "Then the checks it stood in for became Shell.test.tsx: 91 test files, 1581 tests, and a deliberate break in the mode chip failed it"
      ]
    }
  ]
